//----------------------------------------------
// WORKAROUND, keep this block LAST in the .bhv file.
//
// With moos-ivp main (68d862fbd, 2026-09-18) the last BHV_Waypoint in a
// behavior file loses its waypoints on the helm's first iteration when
// NAV_X/NAV_Y are already in the info buffer ("No waypts given" warning,
// then "NothingToDo" when that behavior becomes active). The stock
// ivp/missions/s1_alpha/alpha.bhv shows it too (waypt_return). A never-
// active BHV_Waypoint placed last absorbs it. Repro and details:
// moos-ivp-remora/README.md, "Known issue".
Behavior = BHV_Waypoint
{
  name      = zz_waypt_placeholder
  pwt       = 1
  condition = NEVER_TRUE = true
  points    = pts={0,0}
}
